#: code:addons/whatsapp/controller/onboarding.py:0
msgid "You are not allowed to access this page."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ້ານີ້."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You are not allowed to use %(field)s in phone field, contact your "
"administrator to configure it."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ %(field)s ໃນຟິວເບີໂທ, ຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_template_variable.py:0
msgid "You are not allowed to use field %(field)s, contact your administrator."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຟິວ %(field)s, ຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_message.py:0
msgid "You can not cancel message which is in queue."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄິວໄດ້."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_message.py:0
msgid "You can not resend message which is not in failed state."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ ຖ້າສະຖານະບໍ່ແມ່ນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_template.py:0
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_template_variable.py:0
msgid "You can not select field of %(model)s."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກຟິວຂອງ %(model)s."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/whatsapp/static/src/components/whatsapp_variables_text_field/whatsapp_variables_text_field.js:0
msgid "You can set a maximum of 10 variables."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວແປໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 10 ອັນ."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/discuss_channel_member.py:0
msgid ""
"You can't leave this channel. As you are the owner of this WhatsApp channel, "
"you can only delete it."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອອກຈາກຊ່ອງທາງນີ້ໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງຊ່ອງທາງ WhatsApp ນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບມັນໄ"
"ດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: whatsapp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/whatsapp/models/whatsapp_template.py:0
msgid "You cannot modify a template model when it is linked to server actions."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໂມເດວແມ່ແບບໄດ້ ເມື່ອມັນຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບການດຳເນີນການຂອງເຊີບເວີ."

